Package: KmerEnrich
Title: K-mer Enrichment Analysis of Viral Genomes Against a Vector Background
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Identifies k-mers that are conserved across viral genomes and
    over-represented relative to a vector (e.g. mosquito) background estimated
    from paired-end RNA-seq reads. Maps k-mer positions along viral sequences,
    computes per-k-mer frequency, spacing, enrichment and distribution scores,
    and summarises the results in an HTML report with CSV exports.
Author: Emile Van Cauwenberghe [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Emile Van Cauwenberghe <milouvancau@gmail.com>
